\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18082032\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3907/99d0/111998_normal.png?m=1735525820\" alt=\"flyico\" data-uid=\"111998\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/flyico\">flyico</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 11:46:49 +08:00\">18h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codebuddy 现在有优惠，几百万 token 才几个积分</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18082529\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/920ad340d2af15cb709151c0471c7ea6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mingzefei\" data-uid=\"638879\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mingzefei\">mingzefei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 13:47:54 +08:00\">16h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉 deepseek 官方在缓存上有护城河。其他地方即便是部署了，也做不到它的缓存命中成本。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18082562\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/55579e415f3d312d5b8905b3b9ec0761?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"longaiwp\" data-uid=\"139260\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/longaiwp\">longaiwp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 13:53:29 +08:00\">16h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>主要是缓存这块，其他家始终做不到这个价，所以我们一直都在用官方。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18082849\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5987/bc50/78391_normal.png?m=1788532163\" alt=\"yidinghe\" data-uid=\"78391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yidinghe\">yidinghe</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 14:31:06 +08:00\">15h 40m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/holystrike\">holystrike</a> 说明阿里很鸡贼，这个价格很有隐蔽性。输入和输出确实是一个价，但缓存命中，阿里的价格是官方的五倍。别小看 0.2 vs 0.04 ，你可以自己算下，假设输入 800M token ，缓存命中率 95%，输出为 8M ，DS 官方的费用是 174.4 元，而阿里千问费用是 296 元。800M 是我估算自己一个月的用量。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083369\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8d13/4c44/631792_normal.png?m=1789105870\" alt=\"sentinelK\" data-uid=\"631792\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sentinelK\">sentinelK</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 15:48:31 +08:00\">14h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>阿里的 deepseek 系列很难用，有一个非常莫名奇妙的 TPM 限制……</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n  